      "status": "CORRECT",
      "sourceLine": 43,
      "specificReview": "Qualified wallwise increment_profile_le_wallEnvelope applies to upper (w,e)=(a-y,z-y) and lower (a+y,y-z). Initial interiority gives w>0; terminal interiority gives e<w. The required terminal distances w-e are exactly a-z and a+z by ring identities. Adding the two inequalities yields the exact source P_b<=Pi, with no factor2 exponent error or lost wall.",
