      "status": "CORRECT",
      "sourceLine": 11,
      "specificReview": "The complete transparent value is incrementProfile(a-y,a-z,T,b)+incrementProfile(a+y,a+z,T,b). The consumed complete incrementProfile value is exp(-max(u-|b|,0)*v/T), so this is precisely the source two-wall P_b. Both orientations and all real parameters match the freeze and the actual type.",
